WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:05.140
Security Information and Event Management platforms help organizations collect, normalize,

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.016
analyze, and investigate security-relevant data from across their environments.

00:00:08.016 --> 00:00:13.570
SIEM transforms raw logs into operational awareness by supporting searches, correlations,

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.000
alerts, investigations, and reporting.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.070
Analysts use SIEM to understand suspicious activity, support incident response,

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:21.190
and improve security operations.

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:25.000
Although SIEM is powerful, it requires thoughtful configuration, ongoing tuning,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.880
skilled analysts, and integration with other security capabilities to deliver value.
